flowchart TD
  A([Docked, charging]) --> B{Scheduled time<br/>and weather OK?}
  B -- no --> A
  B -- yes --> C["Preflight checks<br/>battery full, GPS 3D fix, storage free,<br/>wind under limit, geofence loaded"]
  C -- fail --> L1[Log reason, stay docked] --> A
  C -- pass --> D{Unfinished mission<br/>saved?}
  D -- yes --> E[Load remaining waypoints]
  D -- no --> F["Load fixed daily waypoint file<br/>same positions, altitude, heading"]
  E --> G[Send waypoints to Cube: MISSION_ITEM over CAN]
  F --> G
  G --> H[Arm, take off to survey altitude]
  H --> I[Fly to next waypoint]
  I --> J[Capture trigger → Flowchart 2]
  J --> K{Battery below<br/>return reserve?}
  K -- yes --> M[Save progress: last waypoint index]
  K -- no --> N{More waypoints?}
  N -- yes --> I
  N -- no --> O[Mark mission complete]
  M --> P[Return to dock GPS position]
  O --> P
  P --> Q[Hold above dock, start tag search]
  Q --> R{Tag detected?}
  R -- no, retry limit hit --> S[Land at alternate safe point, alert team]
  R -- no --> Q
  R -- yes --> T["Precision descent: LAND_TARGET<br/>offsets to Lua bridge"]
  T --> U{Tag lost<br/>mid-descent?}
  U -- yes --> V[Climb and re-search] --> Q
  U -- no --> W[Touchdown, disarm]
  W --> X{Dock reports<br/>charging?}
  X -- no --> Y["Lift off, re-centre, retry<br/>limited attempts"] --> Q
  X -- yes --> Z([Docked → upload in Flowchart 2])
